WEBVTT

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:06.380
Hey, I didn't catch your name! What was it again?

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.830
Ryu.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.790
Ryu Lion…

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.540
"Ryu"? Kinda hard to pronounce.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.960
Hmm…

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.040
Okay, then!

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.040
From now on, I think I'll call you "Lion"!

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:49.630
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.790
Daphne Lauros

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:08.790
Friend

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.250
Hold out for five minutes…

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.290
If I don't give Mr. Cranel a break now,
he's going to fall apart.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.170
The walls are just beginning to repair themselves…

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.710
Which means monsters shouldn't spawn for a while.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.460
Futaba's my only weapon…

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.500
And given the state of my leg,
I'm not sure how well I can fight…

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:53.250
As long as we manage to escape the Deep Floors,
he's got a decent chance of survival.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
So until we reach the tunnel to the 36th Floor…

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:02.040
Keep him alive, no matter the cost.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.170
I can't move fast enough!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.000
My five minutes was up.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:11.880
Please forgive me. It seems I was a lousy lookout…

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.460
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:24.630
It's your turn to get some sleep, Miss Ryu.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:32.250
Thank you, Mr. Cranel. I think I've… reached my limit.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.130
Lion! Are you listening to me?!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:43.210
Your captain is giving you important information,
and you're staring off into space?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.040
You've got some nerve, missy!

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.710
I'm sorry, Alise.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.080
I shouldn't have gotten distracted…

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.460
I guess I can let it slide.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.420
Oh, I'm dreaming.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:07.380
My memories… of five years ago.

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:12.040
Of the Astrea Familia…

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:22.290
But I thought…

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:28.710
We held out for this long…
only to be consumed by despair?

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.500
Lady Cassandra! Look out!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.960
Miss Haruhime-!

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:55.750
LADY HARUHIME!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.920
Is this really… how it ends?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:12.170
MIKOTO! HARUHIME!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:20.210
Even if it's the last thing I do… YOU'RE GONNA PAY!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:24.710
I'm gonna rip the head OFF YOUR FUCKING NECK!

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.670
Hey, wait-!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.290
I said hold your damn horses!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.380
We have to help them!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.710
Shit!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.880
Die, you son of a bitch!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:06:59.790
We need solid ground!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.170
Comin' up!

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.170
What-?!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.540
Big Guy, no!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:06.710
Get up!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:32.040
Wait a minute!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:35.420
C'mon, blacksmith! FIRE!

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:40.330
It'll be fine! JUST SHOOT!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.460
Shuddup! Don't tell me what to do!

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.420
I'm trusting you on this one…

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.880
HIYO!

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:10.960
DO IT!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:22.380
God of Strength… Bringer of Destruction,
I humbly beseech thee…

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.040
Grant me guidance from the heavens…

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:34.500
Fill my meager body with
thy sublime and sacred power…

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:41.750
Save us, o purifying light… blade of righteousness…

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:48.750
Swing true, o vanquishing sword…
miraculous, steely punishment…

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:55.290
Here and now… I call upon thy name…

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.670
DO IT, MIKOTO!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:02.210
Descend from the heavens and take hold of the earth!

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.250
Conquest of the Gods!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.540
FUTSU NO MITAMA!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:45.880
We can't lose…

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.750
If I sacrifice my life, we can't lose!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.500
Mikoto! She's alive!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:17.540
Haruhime…

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.080
My whole body feels like it's on fire…

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.330
I don't care. Let it burn to a crisp!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.880
So long as my song reaches their ears from the ashes…!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.880
Bless the vessel with thine power.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.880
A tower of riches for a tower of wishes!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:43.040
Come forth, champion of valor!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:50.710
Don't let go, Mikoto!

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.750
KOKUU!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.420
Let them grow!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:11.880
GIVE IT TO ME, HARUHIME!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.420
Uchide no Kozuchi!

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.250
Ravenous blade, thy name is Hippolyta!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.750
HELL KAIOS!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.080
Miss Aisha…

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:19.670
You're all grown up now, aren't you? Silly little fox…

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.380
Mikoto!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:03.420
We did it! We defeated a Floor Boss all on our own!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:08.250
Nice work, everyone. But we're not out of the woods yet.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.290
What's wrong, Lil Squeak?!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.290
Look at this! Amphisbaena dropped an item!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.500
A super-rare Dragon Liver!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.460
Aaand there she goes again…

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.420
Jeez…

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:31.540
Could it be…? Have we broken free
from the cage of despair…?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.210
Does this mean that we're safe…?

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:52.790
What's going on?!

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:54.920
Uh, this looks bad!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.460
Is that… Turk?!

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.040
Those dumbasses!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:09.960
This isn't what we agreed on, Jura!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.960
You didn't tell us something like this might happen!

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:13.500
I get it…

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:16.580
There must be a way to access
the 24th Floor via the tree roots!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.290
Let's follow their lead and bail!

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.170
If we stay here, we'll be buried alive!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.380
No… It's not over.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:27.040
We're still in the middle of my premonition!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:33.170
"The cage of despair shall become a coffin,
and thou shalt suffer."

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:37.380
"Do not forget:

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:42.670
The light thou seekest is the life-giving Sun,
for there is no other."

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.880
"The life-giving Sun"?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.170
But what does the prophecy mean by that?

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.580
I don't know… I don't know!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.790
Wait, Lady Aisha! Master Bell's still down there!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:58.080
Are you kidding me?!
Have you taken a look around lately?!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.380
I know, but look!

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.330
It's the tunnel to the 26th Floor.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.420
All those tremors must've unblocked the entrance!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.380
Hold on! You want us to go in there?!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:11.170
What happens if more debris falls down and traps us?!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:15.290
I agree with Lil Squeak.
We can't leave until we rescue Bell.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.790
Have you lost your mind?!
Haruhime and Mikoto can't even walk!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:21.830
Miss Aisha…

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:26.040
Please, I'll be alright… Find Master Bell…

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.250
Not you, too?!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:31.080
We don't have time to argue the pros and cons!

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.080
We'll figure it out after we've had a chance to regroup!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:36.130
We have to get up there now!

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:37.000
No…

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:38.080
What?!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.040
We need to move east!

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.710
Head down to the 26th Floor, quickly!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.210
Cassandra! What the hell are you talking about?!

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:48.960
You're wrong, Daphne! I was wrong!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.580
I've been getting it wrong this whole time!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:52.460
Huh?!

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.210
The life-giving Sun!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:57.330
When the Sun vanishes, it reappears as a sunrise!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:01.250
So "the life-giving Sun" was referring to a direction!

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.670
Not a person or a time of day!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:08.250
In order to avoid death,
we have to follow the life-giving Sun!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.670
To the EAST!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.040
I'm not sure what the rest of
the prophecy's supposed to mean…

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.460
But we have to go east!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:18.880
Now let's head to the 26th Floor!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:19.630
STOP IT!

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.580
Enough is enough!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.790
We're in the middle of a crisis,
and you're STILL talking nonsense!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:27.960
But in my vision-

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.290
To hell with your vision! Our lives are at stake!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.880
I say we go up. We should climb
our way up to the 24th Floor!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:40.210
Considering the risks,
it's the only logical option we've got!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.630
Get ready to move!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.920
How many times have I felt weak and powerless…?

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:54.500
Daphne's always doubted my premonitions.
She's never once believed me.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:56.710
But…

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.830
Listen to me, Daphne!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.880
I was constantly running away just
by letting myself be afraid!

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.750
I was in pain… It was like torture…

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.830
Nobody ever believed me,
and I didn't want to get hurt anymore!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:12.920
But, I…

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:17.750
I can't stand here and watch my friends die!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:23.250
If I run away now, I'll lose any reason
I ever had to go on living!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.920
Look out! Above us!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.170
Cassandra?!

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:52.710
If ever there was a time to listen to me,
it's now. So please…

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.080
Just trust me, Daphne!

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:02.000
No one would be stupid enough
to believe something like that!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.210
Change of plans. Go east!

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.920
Head for the tunnel to the 26th Floor!

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:11.750
Huh?

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.250
Wait! What the hell are you doing?!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.880
Weren't you just saying it's too dangerous?!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:28.420
I don't trust your ridiculous "visions"
or whatever you call 'em!

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:32.790
But what I do trust… is Cassandra Ilion!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.290
We should get going, too.

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:41.250
Roger!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.210
H-hey, hold on a sec!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:44.460
Let's go with them.

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:48.750
I'd also like to help Master Bell…

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:49.830
Mikoto…

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:52.420
Alright.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.040
Let's move!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.460
Damn it! Fine, but this is on you!

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:23.790
Forget about them! Run, now!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.500
PICK UP THE PACE!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:18.080
If we had tried to climb back up
to the 24th Floor, we'd probably be…

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:19.210
Yeah…

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.170
I'd rather not think about it…

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.630
Cassandra… You saved our lives.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.630
Daphne!

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.830
Thank you for believing me!

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.080
Cut it out! You're squishing me!

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:37.790
Okay, then. Now that we've come this far,
there's no turnin' back until we track down Bell!

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:39.130
Yeah!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
Next Time

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
Ignis

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:40.040
Flame

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.830
Next time: "Ignis."
